# BMW 3 Series E36 four-door saloon, 1991-1998.
#
# The E36 3-series saloon: 4,432 mm long, 1,698 mm wide, 1,393 mm high,
# 2,700 mm wheelbase; 1.6-3.2 sixes and fours, the 320i the volume model. The
# class-3 benchmark of the 1990s in the section F research.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BMW_3_Series_(E36)
#
# Colours: Avus Blue, Calypso Red, Alpine White and Cosmos Black are documented
# BMW finishes of the period.
#
# Weight: 180 in total (blue 55, red 45, white 40, black 40).
#
# Speed 210 km/h; comfort 115/350 (line). Classes 2,3.
# Dates: 1991-1998 with a road tail to about 2009.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/bmw-e36.blend. References:
# citycars/references/bmw-e36/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

